    "body": "Yes, it is, afaict, since you eventually run out of elements that need the initial determination done.\r\n\r\nHmm, it'd be a bit weird that how much a scroll animation advances would depend on whether there are any resize observers or so, I think that means we probably want to do this step only once (maybe at the end so it can react to Resize observers, like the focus fix up?).",
