    "body": "Update:\r\n\r\nStarting with Chrome 148, snapshotting follows the current diff in this PR (alternative 1 above), _apart_ from scroll-driven animations, which does an additional snapshot before the resizeObserver loop as mentioned in the [scroll-animations spec](https://drafts.csswg.org/scroll-animations-1/#event-loop).\r\n\r\nScroll-driven animations would otherwise always be one frame late unless we also updated animation timing during the resizeObserver loop.\r\n",
